<title>CHINA: Huaxin Cement 1996 net down 66.97 pct.</title>
<headline>Huaxin Cement 1996 net down 66.97 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)  Turnover		  307.18	  vs    269.27</p>
<p> Net profit		 15.902	 vs     48.141</p>
<p> Net assets per share    2.16 yuan   vs	2.09 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.06 yuan   vs	0.19 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Huaxin Cement Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement on Monday. All figures are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed not to issue any bonus shares or cash dividend based on 1996 net, pending approval of a shareholders' meeting. ($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
